         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Relating shapes\n\nWe used our body to count at first. The next step was to create shapes. When we look at these shapes, they remind us of our hands. Then we can count.\n\nIn this lesson, we will see how some peoples used shapes that look like the human body to count.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
