                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Circles\n\nThe first step is to look at our body and find a shape that reminds us of something.\n\nFor example, put your fingertips in ink and press them on paper. You will get something like circles.",
