         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Mesoamericans\n\nWhat we showed in this lesson so far is not something new that *History Tracers* created. Thousands of years ago, a counting system, or number system, was created in a region known as Mesoamerica, as shown in the figure.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
