            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Examples\n\nPeople in Mesoamerica counted in different places, such as dates.\n\nIn the next image, we see the dots we taught in this lesson. They were made on a stela built in the past in Oaxaca - Mexico.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
