         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we learned how to count by linking images to our fingers. As an example, we used the numbers that were used in Mesoamerica for more than a thousand years.\n\nIn the next lesson, we will start to study the numbers used today.",
               "source": [],
